VPart 2: Source Inventory
p17
sVparagraphs
p18
(lp19
VThe review tracks four source groups: the landing notes in README.md, the serialized section catalog, the local report package, and the unit-test suite.
p20
aVThe catalog is the authoritative continuation record for this document. Its stored sections cover the source inventory, the validation findings, and the release conclusion.
