g16
VPart 3: Validation Findings
p23
sg18
(lp24
VValidation covers catalog completeness, section resolution, deterministic loading, and the ordinary unit-test entry point.
p25
aVThe catalog test loads the stored sections and checks the terminal records, so a complete review is distinguished from the landing page alone.
